Vakeel Sahayak (bail-assistance research prototype): third-party notices

This file lists the datasets, models, fonts and key libraries the project uses or ships, with licence and required attribution.
Status column: "verified" = read from the official source (Hugging Face model metadata, the dataset's own README or the project
manifest data/raw/MANIFEST.json) on the date shown; "to verify" = stated from the maintainers' public documentation and not yet
re-read from the official page by the team. Re-check before any public release.

DATASETS (not shipped in the repository; data/ is gitignored)

1. Open India Law, release v2026.08.1, by Vaquill AI. Licence CC BY 4.0 for the compilation; the underlying judgments and
   statutes are Government works (Copyright Act 1957, s.17(d) and s.52(1)(q)). Verified 2026-10-19 (data/raw/MANIFEST.json).
   Required attribution: "Structured Indian primary-law data from the Open India Law corpus by Vaquill AI
   (https://github.com/Vaquill-AI/open-india-law), used under CC BY 4.0." We use bail-related shards only and derive
   orders, statutes and citation data from them (changes: filtering, chunking, normalisation).
2. IPC2BNS-Verify (https://github.com/MS-406/IPC2BNS-Verify, commit 8d3e770). The README badge says MIT but the repository has
   no LICENSE file at that commit. Licence status UNCONFIRMED: ask the authors for the file before redistributing derived data.
3. Kathbath (AI4Bharat), Hindi test_known subset, from AI4Bharat's official object store (IndicSUPERB). The IndicSUPERB page
   states CC0 for the packaging (the text comes from IndicCorp); the Hugging Face card says CC BY 4.0. Attribute AI4Bharat:
   Javed et al., "IndicSUPERB", AAAI 2023. Verified 2026-10-19 (manifest).
4. HLDC (Kapoor et al., Findings of ACL 2022) and IL-TUR (Exploration-Lab). NOT downloaded yet (access is manual). HLDC README:
   CC BY-NC 4.0; the IL-TUR card says CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. NON-COMMERCIAL, research use only: nothing derived from them may be used
   commercially, and share-alike applies to derivatives under the IL-TUR terms.
5. Statutes taken from official Indian Government publications (Acts of Parliament) are Government works. The CrPC 1973, NDPS Act
   and First Schedule rows are not yet loaded (official sites blocked automated download; see docs/handoff/data-and-models.md).

